SUMMARY:Mobile in the Gilded Age exhibition at the History Museum of Mobile
LOCATION:History Museum of Mobile\, 111 S Royal St\, Mobile\, AL 36602
DESCRIPTION:Monday to Saturday 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM · Sunday 1:00 PM to 5:00
  PM · through 6/6/2027\n\nThe History Museum of Mobile opened Mobile in t
 he Gilded Age on October 9\, 2026\, and the exhibition stays up through Ju
 ne 6\, 2027. Gowns\, inventions and everyday objects show how railroads\, 
 new technology and department stores changed life in Mobile in the late 18
 00s and early 1900s. The exhibition also covers the unequal opportunities 
 and segregation of the period.\n\nPrice: from $8\n\nDetails: https://coast
 aleventures.com/events/ev-history-museum-mobile-gilded-age-1009.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-history-museum-mobile-gilded-age
 -1009.html
CATEGORIES:Coastal icons
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
