SUMMARY:SS United States Farewell Tour aboard the Perdido Queen
LOCATION:Perdido Queen Cruises\, 1 South Water Street\, Mobile\, AL 36602
DESCRIPTION:Monday 11/9 · departure time is on the booking calendar\n\nPer
 dido Queen Cruises runs a specialty river cruise on November 9\, 2026 so g
 uests can watch the SS United States depart Mobile from the water. The oce
 an liner was the world's fastest\, and a guide tells its story while the b
 oat passes Mobile's working port. The cruise lasts 1 hour with 30 minutes 
 of boarding\, and the climate-controlled boat has open-air balconies and a
  full cash bar.\n\nPrice: from $20.99\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures
 .com/events/ev-ss-united-states-farewell-cruise-mobile-1109.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ss-united-states-farewell-cruise
 -mobile-1109.html
