SUMMARY:December Living History Drill at USS ALABAMA
LOCATION:USS ALABAMA Battleship Memorial Park\, 2703 Battleship Pkwy\, Mobi
 le\, AL 36602
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/5 · 8:00 AM to 3:00 PM\n\nWWII reenactors in Navy 
 uniforms hold their December drill aboard the battleship and the submarine
  USS DRUM. Visitors can talk with the reenactors about shipboard life\, he
 ar stories from the original crew and watch weapons briefings. The drill i
 s part of a regular park visit\, so confirm admission with the park.\n\nPr
 ice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev
 -uss-alabama-december-drill-1205.html
