SUMMARY:Guided tour of the Old Mobile site from Historic Blakeley
LOCATION:East Pointe Baptist Church (charter bus departs for the Old Mobile
  site)\, 34742 AL-225\, Spanish Fort\, AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 12/12 · 8:30 AM to 12:30 PM\n\nHistoric Blakeley Stat
 e Park offers a guided tour of the original site of the town of Mobile\, f
 ounded in 1702 and the capital of French Louisiana until 1711. The site si
 ts on the Mobile River 27 miles north of modern downtown and is not ordina
 rily open to the public. The Friends of Old Mobile will also unveil a new 
 stone monument listing those known to be buried in Mobile's first cemetery
 .\n\nPrice: from $30\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-bl
 akeley-old-mobile-tour-1212.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-old-mobile-tour-1212.ht
